{
  "slug": "enpitech-ai-tools",
  "name": "Enpitech Ai Tools",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "10 years of engineering judgment. One Claude plugin. Zero noise.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `cr-deps` (Run a dependency health audit checking for vulnerabilities, outdated packages, deprecations, license issues, and unused dependencies), `cr-fullstack` (Run a cross-layer code review on a fullstack PR diff, auto-detecting languages and applying the appropriate criteria for…), `cr-general` (Run a 5-pass language-agnostic code review scoped to the current PR diff), `cr-node` (Run a 7-pass Node.js code review scoped to the current PR diff), `cr-python` (Run a 7-pass Python code review scoped to the current PR diff), `cr-react` (Run a 7-pass React/Next.js code review scoped to the current PR diff), `cra-fullstack` (Run a full-codebase cross-layer audit, auto-detecting languages and applying the appropriate criteria for each layer, plus system-level checks…), `cra-general` (Run a full-codebase 5-pass language-agnostic audit with system-level checks and dependency audit), and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install enpitech-ai-tools@claude-community` from `enpitech/ai-tools`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
